Download Version 1.73!
http://www.bigfatsimulations.com/imageHost/zurich.jpg

Airport Madness now has a total of 12 airports to choose from!  We sincerely hope you enjoy this latest update!  Check out these additional bug fixes:


    Resolved issues with sound buttons showing wrong state;
    Resolved issue of “no more aircraft”;
    Fixed incorrect runway numbering in Dubai;
    Achievements page now shows progress towards goals.

