We've resolved several pesky bugs with this update!


    Fixed "clouds" on/off setting not saving;
    Barcelona traffic jam resolved;
    Madness Achievements Fixed;
    Fixed Amsterdam local high scores bug;
    Resolved performance issues on certain older computers;
 Other minor bug fixes.
 

Thank you so much for supporting our development of the Airport Madness series!

